    <item>
      <title>伊朗和阿曼之间即将达成的重新开放霍尔木兹的协议将使特朗普付出代价</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/strait-of-hormuz-possible-reopening-deal.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该协议将允许船只再次航行，解决特朗普总统最紧迫的政治问题。但这将赋予伊朗战前不具备的战略影响力。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/strait-of-hormuz-possible-reopening-deal.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:19:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>自地震以来美国首次向委内瑞拉派遣载有被驱逐者的飞机</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/world/americas/venezuela-us-deportation-flights-resume.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一架载有 147 名委内瑞拉人的飞机周一降落在南美国家，因 6 月地震期间被安置在倒塌建筑物中的被驱逐者死亡引发批评。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/world/americas/venezuela-us-deportation-flights-resume.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:55:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>官员称，被关押在德莱尼拘留中心的移民已经死亡</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/nyregion/ice-detention-center-death-delaney-hall-nj.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[纽瓦克市市长确认死者为埃德温·洛佩兹-科尔内霍。新泽西州中心因其对待被拘留者的待遇而成为严格审查的焦点。]]></description>
